#: tmainform.lblwraphint.caption
msgid "Top bar — Wrapable = True (the default): the 12 tools wrap into 3 rows and the bar grows to 104 px to fit them. Flat = True hands every tool the ghost StyleClass."
msgstr "上面这条工具条 —— Wrapable = True(默认):12 个工具折成 3 行,工具条也长到 104 px 容下它们。Flat = True 给每个工具都套上 ghost StyleClass。"

#: tmainform.lbldownhint.caption
msgid "Down = True — a pressed tool keeps the ghost:selected look. Bold starts pressed; click Bold / Italic / Underline to toggle one."
msgstr "Down = True —— 按下的工具保持 ghost:selected 外观。粗体初始就是按下的,点「粗体」「斜体」「下划线」可切换。"

#: tmainform.lblglyphhint.caption
msgid "New / Open / Save are TTyGlyphButtons — the bar accepts any TTyButton descendant and gives it the same ghost style and row metrics."
msgstr "新建 / 打开 / 保存 是 TTyGlyphButton —— 工具条接受任何 TTyButton 后代,并给它同样的 ghost 样式与行度量。"

#: tmainform.lblframedhint.caption
msgid "Second bar — Flat = False: the bar clears the ghost class, so its tools are framed push buttons. Wrapable = False: they stay on one row, so the last tool runs off the right edge instead of wrapping. ButtonHeight is left unset, so its tool height follows the theme --control-height (classic 24 / modern 38) — switch skins and watch this bar alone change height."
msgstr "第二条工具条 —— Flat = False:清掉 ghost 类,工具变成带边框的按钮。Wrapable = False:它们只留一行,最后一个工具不折行,直接溢出右边缘。ButtonHeight 未设,工具高度跟随主题 --control-height(经典 24 / 现代 38) —— 换皮肤时只有这条工具条会变高。"

#: tmainform.lbllendhint.caption
msgid "ShowCaptions and Images are wired: the bar lends its image collection to any icon-capable tool that has none of its own, and pushes ShowCaptions the same way — a tool the host configured itself is never overridden. This demo's tools use TTyIconFont glyphs instead."
msgstr "ShowCaptions 与 Images 已接线:工具条把自己的图片集合借给没有集合的可绘图标工具,ShowCaptions 也同样下发 —— 宿主自己配置过的工具永远不被覆盖。本示例的工具用的是 TTyIconFont 字体图标。"

