#: tmainform.lbltoolbtnhint.caption
msgid "Third bar — real TTyToolButtons, all six styles: Run = tbsButton, Pin = tbsCheck, a tbsSeparator gap, Day / Week / Month = adjacent Grouped checks (one exclusive group), a tbsDivider line, and both drop-down styles. Wrap = True on Month ends the first row there even though Wrapable is True."
msgstr "第三条 —— 真正的 TTyToolButton,六种样式齐全:运行 = tbsButton,固定 = tbsCheck,一个 tbsSeparator 空位,日 / 周 / 月 = 相邻的 Grouped 开关(互斥一组),一条 tbsDivider 竖线,以及两种下拉样式。「月」上的 Wrap = True 让第一行在此断开 —— 即使 Wrapable 为 True。"

#: tmainform.lbldrophint.caption
msgid "Save (tbsDropDown) is split: only its arrow zone pops the DropdownMenu, the body is a plain click. Export has no menu, so its arrow fires OnArrowClick instead — an assigned menu suppresses that event. Share (tbsButtonDrop) pops its menu from a click anywhere on the face."
msgstr "保存(tbsDropDown)是分裂按钮:只有箭头区弹出 DropdownMenu,主区是普通点击。导出没挂菜单,箭头区改为触发 OnArrowClick —— 挂上菜单就会抑制这个事件。分享(tbsButtonDrop)在按钮面任意位置点击都弹出菜单。"

#: tmainform.lblpainthint.caption
msgid "Fourth and fifth bars — the same three buttons twice: the fourth draws the themed default, the fifth assigns OnPaintButton and that one handler replaces the paint of every button on its bar (LCL's signature and AState integer). Crimson starts Down on both, so compare the checked state."
msgstr "第四、第五条 —— 同样的三个按钮画两遍:第四条是主题默认绘制,第五条挂了 OnPaintButton,这一个处理器就整体替换该条上每个按钮的绘制(签名与 AState 整数照抄 LCL)。两条上「绯红」都初始按下,可对照选中状态。"

